SUMMARY:Mila: Cystic fibrosis screening
DESCRIPTION:Taken from the same blood sample as the extended newborn screen
 ing. It can be caught up within the first four weeks of life.\nCatch up by
  2026-09-29\; after that the entitlement lapses.\nSource: G-BA guideline o
 n early detection of illness in children · as of 2026-09-20\nhttps://www.
 g-ba.de/richtlinien/15/
CATEGORIES:children
URL:https://www.g-ba.de/richtlinien/15/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
