DTSTAMP:20260920T120000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
SUMMARY:Mila: Extended newborn screening
DESCRIPTION:Blood sample screening for metabolic\, hormone and other congen
 ital disorders. Taken no earlier than 36 and no later than 72 hours of lif
 e\; 48 to 72 hours is optimal. A sample missed in this window must be take
 n without delay\, at the latest by the end of the fourth week\, like the c
 ystic fibrosis screening from the same sample.\nCatch up by 2026-09-29\; a
 fter that the entitlement lapses.\nSource: G-BA guideline on early detecti
 on of illness in children · as of 2026-09-20\nhttps://www.g-ba.de/richtli
 nien/15/
CATEGORIES:children
URL:https://www.g-ba.de/richtlinien/15/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
